@startuml
|Higher Studies Coordinator|
start
:Open queue; inspect Submitted record;
|Web UI / API|
:Send request;
|Application Service|
:Check coordinator and Submitted state;
if (Eligible for verification?) then (yes)
  |Repository / Database|
  :Begin transaction;
  :Insert Verification; set Verified; audit; notify student;
  :Commit;
  |Web UI / API|
  :Show success;
else (no)
  |Web UI / API|
  :Reject duplicate or ineligible decision;
endif
stop
@enduml
